          "text": "Field researchers noted salt exposure near the coast while preparing a replacement frame. A safety brace in the school robotics platform forms a right triangle. Its hypotenuse is 35 m and one shorter side is 21 m. Find the other shorter side in metres. Enter the numerical value only."
        }
